  "description": "websocket-sharp provides a WebSocket protocol client and server.\n\nThis maintained fork targets:\n- .NET Framework 3.5\n- .NET Framework 4.5\n- .NET Standard 2.0\n\nIt includes RFC 7692 permessage-deflate compatibility improvements,\nincluding support for valid server_max_window_bits negotiation.\n\nFeatures include:\n- RFC 6455 WebSocket client and server\n- Per-message compression\n- Secure connections\n- HTTP authentication\n- Query strings, Origin headers, and cookies\n- HTTP proxy connections",
